    "Use `setIntegral_mono_on` to sandwich each cell's Lebesgue set integral between its lower and upper Darboux terms."
    "Convert the finite sum of closed-cell set integrals to adjacent interval integrals and telescope them to the integral on the full endpoint interval."
    "Apply `csSup_le` over all lower sums and `le_csInf` over all upper sums."]
